<title>NETHERLANDS: Akzo Nobel sees higher 1997 profits.</title>
<headline>Akzo Nobel sees higher 1997 profits.</headline>
<dateline>ARNHEM, Netherlands 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chemical group Akzo Nobel NV said on Friday it expected 1997 full-year profits to be higher than the record 1.32 billion guilders of 1996.  </p>
<p>&quot;(Akzo Nobel) maintains the expectation expressed earlier of higher profits in 1997 than in 1996,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>Akzo said at the presentation of its 1996 annual results in in February it expected net profits to improve in 1997.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
